OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer assaulted during
OL,4,AOld Firm cup match
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Police Scotland officer was assaulted
OL,7,Fduring Sunday's Old Firm match at
OL,8,FIbrox.
OL,10,FThe force said a 28-year-old man was
OL,11,Farrested in connection with the
OL,12,Fincident at the Premier Sports Cup
OL,13,Fgame, which Rangers won 3-0.
OL,15,FOfficers made a total of four arrests
OL,16,Fduring the quarter-final clash,
OL,17,Fincluding a 55-year-old man for
OL,18,Fsectarian abuse.
OL,20,FA spokesperson said a 25-year-old man
OL,21,Fwas arrested in connection with breach
OL,22,Fof the peace.
